 ounded by its ingresses. 'Any 2' = at least two of the listed bodies in t
 he sign at once\, each meeting its (R) condition. Retrograde = of-date lo
 ngitudinal speed < 0 (station instants as almanacs define them)\; Rahu/Ke
 tu always retrograde (TA p.73). || Sidereal (Lahiri) whole sign of the bo
 dy\; window bounded by its ingresses. One event per residency\; the verdi
 ct column states which list the sign is in. || Swiss Ephemeris (pyswissep
 h\, sepl/semo 18 files)\, sidereal Lahiri ayanamsha\, mean lunar node\, w
